DreamMeshModifierTextAnimation_Selector:Offset {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierTextAnimation.h#DreamMeshModifierTextAnimation_Selector:Offset
    src   "0 means *Properties* will have no effect, 1 means *Properties* have full effect, and middle value is interplation.\nSo we can set this \"offset\" property to make animation."
    text  "0 表示 *属性* 不起作用，1 表示 *属性* 具有全部作用，中间值是插值。\n因此，我们可以设置此“偏移量”属性以进行动画。"
    state machine
}
